        "comments": "Each of these two trees are growing directly over the sewer line. The sewer line is blocked. My plumber ran a camera in the sewer line showing that the roots of the trees have grown into and collapsed the sewer line. I paid my plumber to run a turbo-jet in an attempt to open the sewer line which failed. My only option is to replace the sewer line. My plumber gave me a statement that the two trees must, unfortunately, be be removed to enable him to install the new sewer line to replace the blocked sewer line.",
